        "verse": 11
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 36,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "If they listen and serve him, they will spend their days in prosperity, and their years in pleasures.",
      "ko": "만일 그들이 청종하여 섬기면 형통히 날을 보내며 즐거이 해를 지낼 것이요",
      "source_text_hash": "18ddea64cad5c1e22caac19d50606afb2911e05770c02a3136f2482acdd947cd",
      "translation_text_hash": "bff2a5dc1a8a3b0c6be9476b9c6b8cb6f1fb9f941f3c8726448ee309750a4ca4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "만일 그들이 청종하여 섬기면 형통히 날을 보내며 즐거이 해를 지낼 것이요"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "bff2a5dc1a8a3b0c6be9476b9c6b8cb6f1fb9f941f3c8726448ee309750a4ca4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:JOB:36:12",
      "sequence": 13749,
      "chapter_label": "JOB 36",
      "verse_label": "12",
      "locator": {
